{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57916","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57916","key":"SV-11422","fields":{"summary":"Tech View – First Tab Lands on the Unassigned Header, Not a Work Order Row","parent":{"id":"56398","key":"SV-10054","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56398","fields":{"summary":"Keyboard access and focus — design questions to resolve","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}},"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62425","id":"62425","filename":"C97021-3-tech-first-tab-lands-on-header.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T05:43:59.624-0500","size":168620,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62425","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62425"}],"description":"h2. Description\n\n*In Tech View, the one Tab stop should land on a work order row* — the row last focused, or the first row when none has been — and that row shows the focus ring. On staging the first Tab lands on the *Unassigned* group header instead, even when Unassigned has a work order row under it.\n\nFor example,\n\n* Tech View shows the Unassigned group with one work order row under it\n* pressing Tab from the Search box puts the blue focus ring on the Unassigned group header, not on that row\n* Board View does this correctly: the first Tab lands on the first card\n\nh2. Steps to Reproduce\n\n# Sign in to staging as an Admin and check the top bar shows *Staging Heavy Duty - 9919*.\n# Open *Work Orders*, click the *All* tab, type {{ZZAUTOTEST F3 Keyboard Reach}} in *Search* and click *Tech View*.\n#* The Unassigned group shows one row, {{S2-36336}}.\n# Click once in the *Search* box and press Tab until focus enters the table.\n#* The blue focus ring is on the *Unassigned* group header.\n#* No work order row has the focus ring.\n\n*Actual Result:*\n\n* The first Tab into Tech View lands on the Unassigned group header.\n\n*Expected Result:*\n\n* The first Tab into Tech View lands on a work order row (here the first row, S2-36336), with a visible focus ring.\n\nh2. Screenshots\n\n!C97021-3-tech-first-tab-lands-on-header.png|width=1962,height=1084!\n\nh2. Environment\n\n* *Build:* {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}} on [staging|https://app.staging.shopview.com/workorders] · *Location:* Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 · *User:* Admin · seen 16 Oct 2026\n\nh2. Sources\n\n* [PRD – Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (Confluence page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026), S11-R1:\nEach view is a single Tab stop. Tab lands on one work order row (Tech View) or card (Board View), the one last focused, or the first one when none has been; the focused row or card shows a visible focus ring.\n\nh2. Test case\n\n* [C97021 Tab reaches every card, row and header in on-screen order with a focus ring|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/97021]","issuelinks":[{"id":"33601","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33601","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"56398","key":"SV-10054","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56398","fields":{"summary":"Keyboard access and focus — design questions to resolve","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}}}],"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57916/comment/78872","id":"78872","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb] valid. The Tab stop must land on a work order row, never the Unassigned header while a row is shown. With every group collapsed it lands on the first group header (PRD v60). [~accountid:712020:b2d16ade-9013-4875-8a9d-e255e63e8217] [~accountid:712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e] for QA: test against [PRD v60|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] S11-R1.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.